PROBLEM STATEMENT:
Sample Input
7
UK
China
USA
France
New Zealand
UK
France 

Sample Output
5
PROGRAM:
n = int(input())
distinct_stamps = set()
for _ in range(n):
    country = input()
    distinct_stamps.add(country)
print(len(distinct_stamps))

OUTPUT:
Input (stdin)
    7
    UK
    China
    USA
    France
    New Zealand
    UK
    France

Your Output (stdout)
    5
